{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3mU8cXPx16VHeHR5f3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the Lock.\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║          ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄            ║\n║        ▄█████████████▄           ║\n║       ██████████████████         ║\n║       ██████████████████         ║\n║       ▀▀▀▀▀████████▀▀▀▀         ║\n║            ██████████            ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ██████▓▓██████            ║\n║        █████▓▓▓▓█████            ║\n║        ██████▓▓██████            ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║        ████████████████          ║\n║         ██████████████           ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║   I render nothing without a     ║\n║   key.                           ║\n║                                  ║\n║   Present the key.               ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nThe tumblers wait. The mechanism holds. No key has been parsed.\n\n**I do not open.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":372,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}